WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
Have you ever read an anime description for a show you just watched and you're just like-

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:03.240
MAN

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.100
THIS IS

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.540
This is nothing like what the show is actually about

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:10.040
Yeah. Most of the descriptions I find don't really contain the information we need

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.680
Either they oversell something or undersell something

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.660
or aren't really indicative to the watching experience of the anime

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.840
So, I thought I'd play a fun game with myself and see if I could fix some anime descriptions

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.260
to contain the information that we really need to know

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.600
Alright, so let's start off with something I'm sure we can all agree with

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.700
you know, something very...

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:25.860
very simple you know

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:26.860
easy quick fix

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.300
Boku no Pico

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.120
STOP RECOMMENDING THIS ANIME TO PEOPLE YOU PIECES OF SHI--

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:32.880
but actucally watch it tho ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:47.040
Battle Royal

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:48.180
Diary game

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:49.740
Predicting the future

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.100
Ok, you get the point

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:55.260
But see, this is the perfect example of a description that desperatly needs fixing

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:56.220
It's too tame

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:58.540
It makes it sound way more complex than it actually is

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.640
and it doesn't even mention the entire reason it got so popular

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.780
let's be real about this

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:21.640
Yeah I think...

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:23.080
I think that should about do it

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:23.760
POKEMON

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.240
Alright this should be pretty easy

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:26.680
I mean everyone grew up with this

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:31.920
OH GOD

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:36.340
Jesus Wikipedia! Do we really need a page worth of plot summary to explain Pokemon

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:38.120
It's really not that complicated

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.200
Look, let me cut out some of this fat for you

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:56.020
mmh mmh

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:57.220
Jojo's Bizarre Adventure

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:59.940
Now, how do we even begin to describe this anime?

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:01.400
Well, actually, it's pretty simple

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:04.000
but we're not going to give the series much justice with this description

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.240
Look, if it's Jojo's

